{"src":"es","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":203000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"es","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9290.054619,"text":"Los leones son los felinos que más socializan y su vida transcurre dentro de grupos de gran tamaño denominados manadas."},{"kind":"text","t":9660.340637000001,"text":"Lions are the most social felines, and their lives are spent within large groups known as prides."},{"kind":"audio","t":9711.543728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9716.038614000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":9721.092593000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9726.419599,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9730.789157000001,"samples":29728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":15441.240217999999,"text":"En medio del cálido clima del Oriente Medio, la casa no era de mayor importancia."},{"kind":"text","t":15748.932004999999,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not of great importance."},{"kind":"audio","t":15794.904179000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15799.800640000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15805.147245,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15809.524784000001,"samples":31296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":23045.979765,"text":"Las playas son casi todas de arena con lugares seguros para nadar y en su mayoría tienen árboles."},{"kind":"text","t":23372.062984,"text":"The beaches are almost all sandy, with safe areas for swimming, and most of them have trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":23410.707981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23415.331086000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":23420.68593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23425.743969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23430.593651,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"input","t":27307.754279,"text":"Poutukawa, que ofrecen lugares de sombra."},{"kind":"text","t":27512.906787,"text":"Poutukawa trees, which provide shaded areas."},{"kind":"audio","t":27557.790226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27562.577499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27566.928508,"samples":29264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":36172.296946,"text":"Las manadas están formadas por uno a tres machos adultos del mismo grupo familiar, unidos con hasta 30 hembras y sus crías."},{"kind":"text","t":36632.172495,"text":"The herds consist of one to three adult males from the same family group, along with up to 30 females and their young."},{"kind":"audio","t":36698.341196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36703.443604,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36708.752839,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36713.823328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36719.214892,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36724.752384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":36725.08414,"samples":6192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":46188.242717,"text":"Es posible que los niños salvajes hayan sufrido situaciones traumáticas o abuso infantil grave antes de ser abandonados o de que huyeran."},{"kind":"text","t":46530.937912,"text":"It’s possible that these feral children suffered traumatic situations or severe child abuse before being abandoned or fleeing."},{"kind":"audio","t":46584.48167,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":46589.702686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46594.920693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46599.945192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46605.222708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46610.533894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46614.566177,"samples":26592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":54366.051762,"text":"En Skoturb, el autobús 403 se dirige con regularidad a Sintra y para en Cabo da Roca."},{"kind":"text","t":54761.174361,"text":"In Skoturb, bus 403 regularly travels to Sintra and stops at Cabo da Roca."},{"kind":"audio","t":54811.894078,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":54817.176684,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54822.162514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54827.43876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54832.651017000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54834.225455,"samples":14360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":62175.224117,"text":"La forma de disfrutar las mejores vistas de Hong Kong es salir de la isla y dirigirse a la ribera de Kowloon."},{"kind":"text","t":62578.757717,"text":"The best way to enjoy the best views of Hong Kong is to leave the island and head to the Kowloon waterfront."},{"kind":"audio","t":62621.612835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62626.709414,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62631.684614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62636.96228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":62642.229166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62645.835515,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":64378.146397000004,"text":"ubicada enfrente."},{"kind":"text","t":64494.64081,"text":"located across from it."},{"kind":"audio","t":64551.59188000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64554.132404,"samples":23032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":71755.069754,"text":"Los pensamientos de Aristóteles, en especial las cuestiones de la ciencia, incluso la psicología, fueron aceptadas."},{"kind":"text","t":72034.225263,"text":"Aristotle’s ideas, especially those on science and even psychology, were accepted."},{"kind":"audio","t":72083.883525,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72088.775156,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72094.15492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72099.484686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72102.190538,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":80364.19355,"text":"Mitchell Gurley de Australia obtuvo el undécimo puesto en la categoría masculina de pie del slalom supergigante."},{"kind":"text","t":80656.464504,"text":"Australia’s Mitchell Gurley finished eleventh in the men’s standing super-G event."},{"kind":"audio","t":80716.174995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80720.961998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80726.286943,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80731.77297600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"audio","t":80732.036892,"samples":2728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":87261.24787,"text":"El competidor checo, Oldrik Jelinek, terminó decimosexto en el grupo masculino de sentados."},{"kind":"text","t":87556.259375,"text":"Czech competitor Oldrik Jelinek finished sixteenth in the men’s sitting category."},{"kind":"audio","t":87592.94444,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87597.87185,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87603.177326,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87608.57248,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":87608.933805,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":94258.58737,"text":"La ciudad contrasta mucho con los restantes del país, ya que posee un estilo más árabe que africano."},{"kind":"text","t":94670.167558,"text":"The city is very different from the rest of the country, as it has a more Arab-style appearance rather than an African one."},{"kind":"audio","t":94723.42510000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94728.641596,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94733.821424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94739.140879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94744.280277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94749.32034600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"audio","t":94749.623832,"samples":192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101557.26276700001,"text":"Asimismo, luego de la revolución, los puestos estuvieron abiertos a todos los candidatos masculinos."},{"kind":"text","t":101817.348783,"text":"Additionally, after the revolution, the positions were open to all male candidates."},{"kind":"audio","t":101855.226301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101860.207181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":101865.491077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101870.705674,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101872.925532,"samples":18328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":106732.30724,"text":"lo que permitió el éxito de los más ambiciosos y prestigiosos."},{"kind":"text","t":106945.319678,"text":"which enabled the success of the most ambitious and prestigious ones."},{"kind":"audio","t":106991.912293,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106996.661386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107002.031651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107005.68517900001,"samples":26496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":115981.223267,"text":"La bomba atómica opera en base al principio de que se requiere energía para conformar un núcleo con gran cantidad de protones y neutrones."},{"kind":"text","t":116398.169429,"text":"The atomic bomb operates on the principle that energy is required to form a nucleus with a large number of protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":116452.586445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116457.802051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116463.016848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116468.336784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116473.59021,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116478.848116,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116482.702812,"samples":27192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":123561.820833,"text":"No mencionó una cifra para los recortes y manifestó que se harán en base a la producción económica de China."},{"kind":"text","t":123943.49381100001,"text":"He did not mention a specific figure for the cuts and said they would be determined based on China’s economic output."},{"kind":"audio","t":123997.62399000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124002.880597,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124007.974625,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124013.28741,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124018.584756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124022.241145,"samples":25760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":130764.685296,"text":"No hay un criterio universal que determine cuándo un bien manufacturado puede ser considerado una antigüedad."},{"kind":"text","t":131046.29557999999,"text":"There is no universal criterion to determine when a manufactured item can be considered an antique."},{"kind":"audio","t":131096.13397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131101.402286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131106.393545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131111.72657099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131116.929897,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131119.100927,"samples":18560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":137441.836335,"text":"Algunas agencias impositivas tienen establecido que los objetos de más de 100 años son antigüedades."},{"kind":"text","t":137751.73114199998,"text":"Some tax authorities have established that items over 100 years old are antiques."},{"kind":"audio","t":137801.967246,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137807.018915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":137812.383809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137817.68932499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137819.52513899998,"samples":15928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":143325.96523499998,"text":"No siempre se precisa un yate en los archipiélagos y lagos."},{"kind":"text","t":143549.81942999997,"text":"Yachts aren’t always necessary in archipelagos and lakes."},{"kind":"audio","t":143592.320453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143597.674308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143603.051162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":143603.65155399998,"samples":10296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":154827.91289799998,"text":"Por ello se dice que la relación dimensional de este formato, dividir por 12 a fin de calcular la razón de números enteros más sencilla, equivale a 3.2."},{"kind":"text","t":155323.86909,"text":"That’s why it is said that the dimensional ratio of this format, divided by 12 to calculate the simplest integer ratio, equals 3.2."},{"kind":"audio","t":155380.12435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155385.36206599997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155390.514914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":155395.77013,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":155401.156784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155406.364771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":155411.68139699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155413.432182,"samples":21424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"input","t":164894.88846199997,"text":"Su fama de ser epicentro del lujo comenzó aproximadamente en el 400 a.C. y se extendió hasta aproximadamente 1100 d.C."},{"kind":"text","t":165296.69108699998,"text":"Its reputation as a hub of luxury began around 400 BC and lasted until around 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":165350.478611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165356.02928299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":165361.590745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165366.838661,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":165372.457152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165378.349019,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165383.46410699998,"samples":31992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":178680.29980299997,"text":"Existen diferentes tipos de pólizas de cancelación de viajes pero desde finales del marzo la cobertura de gran parte de estas pólizas basadas en el coronavirus no se extiende hasta julio de 2020."},{"kind":"text","t":179238.840126,"text":"There are different types of travel cancellation policies, but since the end of March, coverage for most of these coronavirus-based policies does not extend beyond July 2020."},{"kind":"audio","t":179300.83439499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179306.07011099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179311.273608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179316.665242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":179322.16112499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179327.51786999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":179332.75048599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":179336.03128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179339.426353,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":179339.733048,"samples":8688,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":181717.97652499998,"text":"que es para cuando están programados los Juegos Olímpicos."},{"kind":"text","t":181906.835792,"text":"which is for when the Olympic Games are scheduled."},{"kind":"audio","t":181947.53352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181948.62049499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181949.317215,"samples":16664,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":191289.286882,"text":"Agite ambos polvos secos juntos y después de hacerlo con las manos higienizadas y húmedas, exprímalos para formar una bola."},{"kind":"text","t":191672.003955,"text":"Mix both dry powders together, then use your clean, wet hands to squeeze them together to form a ball."},{"kind":"audio","t":191723.111087,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":191732.691053,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":191733.544401,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":191734.158962,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":191734.870042,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":191735.05773899998,"samples":13160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":201923.01091299998,"text":"Durante los cruceros por San Petersburgo también se pasa tiempo en la ciudad. Se exime a quienes desembarcan de los requerimientos de visado. Consulte términos."},{"kind":"text","t":202252.08146,"text":"During cruises in St. Petersburg, time is also spent in the city. Those who disembark are exempt from visa requirements. Check the terms."},{"kind":"audio","t":202298.47354799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202303.550437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":202308.748454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202312.5592,"samples":25296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"audio","t":202336.53900299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202337.756366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202339.38008399997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":202339.66128,"samples":4896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":202399.60748699997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":202399.96521199998,"samples":9232,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":213106.53155999997,"code":1005}]}